		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "eb668793-86cd-445f-8fbf-119b2490f0a5")
	)
	(text "using the rail's NOMINAL 5.00V and VF TYP (1.52V), but +5V reaches these anodes"
